{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118027","id":3470966565,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7O4r8l","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118027","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118027.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118027.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118027","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118027/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118027/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118027/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/28cb217ac353b39adef56ee1a24fece5d1398e37","number":118027,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Mark template function in math_funcs_binary constexpr","user":{"login":"zhehangd","id":9572364,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NzIzNjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9572364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd","html_url":"https://github.com/zhehangd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"In fixing a compile error of my gdextension I noticed the inconsistency of using `inline`, `inline static`, `constexpr` between `godot-cpp`([`include/godot_cpp/core/defs.hpp`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp/blob/master/include/godot_cpp/core/defs.hpp))  and `godot` ([`core/math/math_funcs_binary.h`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/core/math/math_funcs_binary.h)). The detail of my issue can be found below:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp/pull/1962\r\n\r\n`godot` uses `constexpr` for most of functions in that file except for the two template functions `is_power_of_2` and `nearest_power_of_2_templated` which use just `inline`. `godot-cpp` uses `static inline` everywhere, and the `static inline` template function made my gdextension lib fail to build. Though I am not sure if it is a real error according to C++ standard or is just a clang bug with module, but I think `static inline` is not something appropriate in modern C++. So to be consistent I suggest that we put everything `constexpr` while possible. For the engine the only change is the two template functions.\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/470